{
  "_comentario": [
    "Accesorios de Homebridge para el Monitor SEN66, plugin homebridge-mqttthing.",
    "Pegar el contenido de 'accessories' dentro del array accessories de tu",
    "config.json de Homebridge. Sustituir IP-DE-TU-DIETPI, el usuario y la",
    "contrasena de Mosquitto, y sen66-XXXXXX por el id que salga en el panel",
    "web del aparato si el tuyo es otro.",
    "",
    "Los cinco niveles que calcula el firmware mapean uno a uno con los cinco",
    "de HomeKit, asi que la pantalla del aparato y la app Casa dicen lo mismo.",
    "",
    "VOC y NOx no aparecen a proposito: HomeKit espera densidades en ug/m3 y",
    "el SEN66 da indices adimensionales. Ver docs/HOMEBRIDGE.md."
  ],
  "accessories": [
    {
      "accessory": "mqttthing",
      "type": "airQualitySensor",
      "name": "Calidad del aire",
      "url": "mqtt://IP-DE-TU-DIETPI:1883",
      "username": "monitor",
      "password": "LA-QUE-PUSISTE",
      "serviceNames": {
        "temperature": "Temperatura",
        "humidity": "Humedad"
      },
      "topics": {
        "getOnline": {
          "topic": "sen66-XXXXXX/status",
          "apply": "return String(message).trim() === 'online';"
        },
        "getAirQuality": {
          "topic": "sen66-XXXXXX/state",
          "apply": "const m = {BUENO:'EXCELLENT', ACEPTABLE:'GOOD', REGULAR:'FAIR', MALO:'INFERIOR', 'MUY MALO':'POOR'}; return m[JSON.parse(message).level] || 'UNKNOWN';"
        },
        "getPM2_5Density": {
          "topic": "sen66-XXXXXX/state",
          "apply": "return JSON.parse(message).pm25;"
        },
        "getPM10Density": {
          "topic": "sen66-XXXXXX/state",
          "apply": "return JSON.parse(message).pm10;"
        },
        "getCarbonDioxideLevel": {
          "topic": "sen66-XXXXXX/state",
          "apply": "return JSON.parse(message).co2;"
        },
        "getCurrentTemperature": {
          "topic": "sen66-XXXXXX/state",
          "apply": "return JSON.parse(message).temperature;"
        },
        "getCurrentRelativeHumidity": {
          "topic": "sen66-XXXXXX/state",
          "apply": "return JSON.parse(message).humidity;"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "accessory": "mqttthing",
      "type": "carbonDioxideSensor",
      "name": "CO2",
      "url": "mqtt://IP-DE-TU-DIETPI:1883",
      "username": "monitor",
      "password": "LA-QUE-PUSISTE",
      "topics": {
        "getOnline": {
          "topic": "sen66-XXXXXX/status",
          "apply": "return String(message).trim() === 'online';"
        },
        "getCarbonDioxideDetected": {
          "topic": "sen66-XXXXXX/state",
          "apply": "return JSON.parse(message).co2 > 1200 ? 'ABNORMAL' : 'NORMAL';"
        },
        "getCarbonDioxideLevel": {
          "topic": "sen66-XXXXXX/state",
          "apply": "return JSON.parse(message).co2;"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
